# Line-ending and diff policy.
#
# NOTE: this repo previously declared git-lfs filters for *.pdb/*.cif/*.npy/
# *.pickle/*.pdf and others. They were removed 2026-08-27: LFS was never
# actually in use (210 of 211 matching files were stored as ordinary git
# blobs, and there was no LFS remote), so the declaration did nothing on
# hosts without git-lfs and silently replaced file contents with pointer
# text on hosts that had it. That is how
# stage4_preprocess/jaspar_h11mo_cluster_wise_dna_containing_dataset.npy
# was truncated to a 130-byte pointer. The largest file in the repo is
# ~7 MB, well under GitHub's 100 MB limit, so LFS is not needed.
#
# If a genuinely large binary is ever added, set up git-lfs properly
# (install it on EVERY machine that commits, and push the objects) rather
# than re-adding filter lines here.

# Normalize line endings for text data/docs (CRLF crept in via laptop edits).
*.csv text=auto
*.md  text=auto
*.tsv text=auto
